{"unit_id":"DoreiHime__dsh-help-me-to-ask#card-zh","repo":"DoreiHime/dsh-help-me-to-ask","commit":"8d062cb2973e818467bc68c660b872839cca9d60","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-HelpMe-To-Ask 是 DSH 网页端插件，会在新会话首条工作消息处理前检查需求。信息不足时，它显示澄清卡，帮助补齐目标、交付物、限制和验收标准；用户也可一键生成任务说明。简报确认后加入当前会话，后续明确改口时可更新。插件提供逐轮追问、跳过和任务说明确认设置，并用 DSH 可用模型进行分析；会话状态保存在本机 DSH_HOME（默认 ~/.dsh）。适合希望先明确任务再开始工作的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:178-248","index.js:260-383","index.js:823-842","client.js:1943-1963"]}
{"unit_id":"DoreiHime__dsh-help-me-to-ask#card-en","repo":"DoreiHime/dsh-help-me-to-ask","commit":"8d062cb2973e818467bc68c660b872839cca9d60","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-HelpMe-To-Ask clarifies a DSH chat’s first work request. It asks for missing goals, deliverables, constraints, or acceptance criteria, then turns replies into a brief for confirmation and adds it to the conversation. Users can update the brief when goals change; session state stays local.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:178-248","index.js:260-383","index.js:823-842","client.js:1943-1963"]}
