{"unit_id":"DoreiHime__dsh-help-me-to-ask#feature-1","repo":"DoreiHime/dsh-help-me-to-ask","commit":"8d062cb2973e818467bc68c660b872839cca9d60","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-HelpMe-To-Ask 的功能「生成前澄清」：在会话首条工作消息进入处理流程前分析需求；发现缺少关键细节时显示问题卡片，用户可逐轮补充或跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:260-370"]}
